  "prefLabel": "Cul-H 203.03 Issuance and Publication of Declaratory Ruling",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Cul-H 203.03 Issuance and Publication of Declaratory Ruling. In accordance with RSA 541-A:16, II (b), declaratory rulings issued by the commissioner shall be filed on the day of issue with the director of legislative services.\n\nSource. #10218, eff 10-30-12, EXPIRED: 7-1-18",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/cul-h200.html"
